Release Notes STM32MP13x OpenSTLinux BSP:
========================================

BSP-Yocto-OpenSTLinux-STM32MP13x-PD23.1.0 2023-10-06
====================================================
- Linux ST Vendor Kernel v5.15.67
  * Tag v5.15-phy2
- U-boot ST Vendor v2021.10
  * Tag v2021.10-phy2
- TF-A ST Vendor v2.6
  * Tag v2.6-phy2
- OP-TEE ST Vendor 3.16.0
  * Tag 3.16.0-phy1

- Linux integration from STM32MP1-ecosystem-v4.1.0: "openstlinux-5.15-yocto-kirkstone-mp1-v22.11.23"
  (based on Yocto Kirkstone)

Tested Yocto Images:
--------------------
- st-image-weston (DISTRO=openstlinux-weston) on:
  * phyboard-segin-stm32mp13x-1
  * phyboard-segin-stm32mp13x-2

- st-image-core (DISTRO=openstlinux-eglfs) on:
  * phyboard-segin-stm32mp13x-2

Build Environment:
------------------
- Ubuntu 20.04 64-bit

Features:
---------
- The BSP features are provided by OpenSTLinux v4.1.0:
  For more details on the features, please refer to the following ST relase notes:
       * STM32MP1-ecosystem-v4.1.0: https://wiki.st.com/stm32mpu-ecosystem-v4/wiki/STM32_MPU_ecosystem_release_note_-_v4.1.0
       * OpenSTLinux v4.1.0: https://wiki.st.com/stm32mpu-ecosystem-v4/wiki/STM32_MPU_OpenSTLinux_release_note_-_v4.1.0

- Features provided by PHYTEC BSP adaptation:

  * Boot support:
    * Boot from SD-card / eMMC

  * Flash devices support:
    * eMMC (u-boot/kernel)
    * SD-card (u-boot/kernel)

  * phyBOARD-Segin addons support:
    * PEB-EVAL-01 (evaluation board with UART debug console, JTAG, user leds and buttons)
    * PEB-AV-01 (HDMI module)
    * PEB-AV-02 with AC158 EDT 7" capacitive touch screen display support
    * PEB-AV-02 with AC093-T EDT 7" resistive touch screen display support
    * phyCAM-P VM-016 BW & COL

  * Peripherals support:
    * I2C (u-boot/kernel)
    * UARTs (u-boot/kernel)
    * EEPROM (u-boot/kernel)
    * USB-Host (u-boot/kernel)
    * USB-OTG (u-boot/kernel)
    * Ethernet on SOM - 100Mpbs (u-boot/kernel)
    * Ethernet on Segin board - 100Mpbs (kernel)
    * CAN FD (kernel)
    * SPI (kernel)
    * Audio codec support - TLV320AIC3007 (kernel)
    * RTC - RV-4162-C7 (kernel)
    * PWM (kernel)
    * LTDC parralel display interface (kernel)
    * DCMIPP camera interface (kernel)
    * GPIOs (u-boot/kernel)
    * User buttons and leds support (kernel)

  * Add extra OpenSTLinux custom distributions:
    - openstlinux-weston-rauc: same as "openstlinux-weston" distro but with RAUC feature enable for Secure SW update
    - openstlinux-eglfs-rauc: same as "openstlinux-eglfs" distro but with RAUC feature enable for Secure SW update
